id: cs_mirage
name: Mirage
description: Mirage. Footprint traced from the published radar, then annotated by hand with the callouts, elevations, ramps and cover the radar cannot carry. A topology reconstruction - proportions are approximate and no assets from the shipped game are used.
grid: 1.42
wall_thickness: 0.32

layer ground z=0 height=6.0 roof=no

